    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SKY HARBOR AIRPORT\nMunicipal Airport\nPhoenix, Arizona\nThe unusual tubular_control tower,\none of the\nworld's largest, is 107 feet high and nine feet in\ndiameter. The airport was built at a cost of\nwell-over one million dollars and accommodates\nthe landings of more than 50 scheduled airlines\ndaily. Barber shop, gift shop and restaurant are\nwithin the terminal building.\nColor Photo by Bob Van Luchene\nPublished by Petley Studios, Phoenix, Arizona\n34264\n2015.166.2202"
    ],
